WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.821
Clubdrop turns club merch into one campaign link and organized preorders.

2
00:00:05.821 --> 00:00:10.299
Share a drop page, collect sizes, and keep everything tidy.

3
00:00:10.299 --> 00:00:12.500
Buyers don't need an account.

4
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:18.949
Fixed templates like Issue give every drop a polished magazine-style look.

5
00:00:18.949 --> 00:00:22.534
Story, products, and a clear path to preorder.

6
00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:24.327
Ready for campus merch.

7
00:00:25.007 --> 00:00:31.869
Switch to Commons or Signal and the same campaign wears a completely different visual system.

8
00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:36.812
Clubs pick a fixed template; buyers always land on a finished page.

9
00:00:37.492 --> 00:00:47.735
On the public preorder form, buyers enter contact details, choose tee size and color, set quantity, and submit in minutes.

10
00:00:47.735 --> 00:00:49.415
No sign-in required.

11
00:00:50.095 --> 00:00:51.426
Demo complete.

12
00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:57.131
They see the preorder total, payment notes, and pickup info.

13
00:00:57.131 --> 00:00:59.698
With no real order created.

14
00:00:59.698 --> 00:01:00.554
One link.

15
00:01:00.554 --> 00:01:01.600
Less chaos.
